### Enhancements

* Avoid realizing the full package index during `conda-build` solves. Local `file://` channels are now discovered from `expanded_channels` without materializing every `PackageRecord`, so solves against large channels (e.g. `conda-forge` plus `bioconda`) no longer stall for minutes. (conda/conda-build#4961)

